    - target: {fileID: 6323976274680666116, guid: cdbab98309455824ea3ccddc45f0ddc6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "This is a typical Admin & User Whitelist Setup. It allows giving access
        to other users while only allowing Admins to do so.\n\nIt combines multiple
        systems into one:\n- String Loaded Local Admin Whitelist\n- Sycned User Whitelist\n  
        - Can only be adjusted by Admins\n- Combined Whitelist of Admins & Users\n 
        - Used for giving actual access to things like Teleports, \n    Selector
        UIs etc.\n\nThis System can be used to for example give DJs, etc access to
        areas and specifc settings."
