    - target: {fileID: 6323976274680666116, guid: cdbab98309455824ea3ccddc45f0ddc6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'It is created by combining multiple Whitelists, Synced Whitelists,
        Combiners, etc., and then connecting them to the Permission Manager.


        Whitelists
        / Permissions:

        - Admin: Instance Master + Local List

        -
        Staff: Assigned by Admins

        - Bartender: Assigned by Admins + Staff

        -
        DJ: Assigned by Admins + Staff


        If you want to expand this, you
        could also add save buttons that would allow, for example, Admins to save
        the different Whitelists and restore them later.


        On the right side
        you can find a few Whitelist Name Displays that allow viewing each Whitelist
        individually.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
