      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6323976274680666116, guid: cdbab98309455824ea3ccddc45f0ddc6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<size=8><color=grey>                                                                                                               
        Version 0.9.0</color></size>\nThis world showcases my UI System which has
        a big focus on animations!\n\nIt can be used to make any sort of UIs and
        has been used in Worlds like:\n- The Furry Hideout | By Lt_Shadow\n- Golden
        Hour 2 | By Itz Soph\n\nIf you would like to commission me for a World UI
        / want to get a quote for just the package it self, feel free to contact
        me!\n- https://drblackrat.xyz\n- Discord: drblackrat\n\nFeatures:\n- Bouncy
        Buttons:\n   Everything is Animated with code using animation \n   curves
        to make it feel smooth.\n- Modular & Expandability:\n   It's fully modular,
        the same script is used for Toggles, \n   Multiselect Buttons, Toggles etc.\n-
        Persistence:\n   Everything has the option to be persisted, \n   even sliders!\n-
        Easy To Use:\n   It's really easy to setup! Native support for object \n  
        toggles, sending the state to other scripts or adjusting \n   Post Processing."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6323976274680666116, guid: cdbab98309455824ea3ccddc45f0ddc6,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor.b
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6323976274680666116, guid: cdbab98309455824ea3ccddc45f0ddc6,
        type: 3}
